&_nc_oc=AdoNZF1ALdClgmkfFqndOJstcV-qSuqnoNx3L36yqRtCams8-X0H9qlOuWK6kcI7EpM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGUCh0EKrL7_smErZmWUluolp2pr7ptvDKIrXQqFq1ASw&oe=6A86E1FE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N8ZvmcIfShEQ7kNvwGS_I1m&_nc_oc=AdpwaP-gtzeI--mZtY_jPeXbdemPLTcXLyRRuQRNfDbBhW9ZkJgI3Y19p9v71zEcpJQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG4HW0A9UpqSTmcbf1Fe4559HhLCnUdHadWjFy1LM1biw&oe=6A86F2FC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QPjULVfUEPgQ7kNvwFf-HLw&_nc_oc=Adotx79CvWP_ffg06MyM_Sg2KtvN6ZOI7QVM3TLq5fBVf-2VdujHuDslb8_OuB-vYqg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGO5Dg_fq-MZB_m-zDgaBzOulj8TtTL4nmCMIWvJgziCw&oe=6A86D947"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q3uSd0r9OIIQ7kNvwHYc6Dg&_nc_oc=AdoyV5QPJi_h7bodzNeG6Komu5gHzf_Ef4EKuY8zujZ0eLz4XlaCr1M44yVrP0jOy5w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEqEL34L_xddSztdQWRhIq9iYlW3exCMM7q44ugt6PLog&oe=6A86FD55"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5VfrcI1ExUIQ7kNvwEMksMP&_nc_oc=AdqsC-l1LrHbDjnC2UeyhuqvhwIp4z6G3OCb8_hHFeYH-RKXFwsUU1T2ndGqmAFC0xo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGXv-evK-Id1hMk3ZyNHfYhG2_9wJMvg0syj_0GCT45uQ&oe=6A86D1A4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.